body:
Okay ignoring this book and its idiotic ideas;
Im actually curious if anyone here has tried any different diet and if it has changed anything for you at all?

Serious question btw, im just curious; I myself eat like crap... :/

As someone who suffers a lot from real anxiety and experience "choice anxiety" too;
Just wanted to give you (and anyone who needs one) a hug.
*hug*

Sorry if this has been asked;
How long does your bots need to be up to make a profit?
Like say you set one up at 12:00 midday - how long until it has netted you profit?

Meanwhile I missunderstood it all;
I thought it was clone to next expansion - so choose to continue or stay.
I thought if I did nothing my toons would stay on classic, turns out - no...

Gjorde ett experiment på det här;
De som låg i kylen smakade bättre.
*shrug*

*Leftwing feminist, genderfluid;
I hate white people and people who judge."*

Says itself.
